      "full_text": "Chief Red Deer, Kenneth S. Clark Sr., Chief of the Nanticoke Indian Tribe for \n  over 30 years, son and grandson of Nanticoke Chiefs, passed away at home on \n  his ancestral lands on October 9, 2015, a month before his 85th birthday.",
      "source_url": "https://nativeamericansofdelawarestate.com/Obituaries%20added%202016-04-03.htm"
    },
    {
